            "python": "p q r | (p|q)->r  ((p->q)&(q->r))->(p->r)  p&~p\nF F F |    T                 T              F\nF F T |    T                 T              F\nF T F |    F                 T              F\nF T T |    T                 T              F\nT F F |    F                 T              F\nT F T |    T                 T              F\nT T F |    F                 T              F\nT T T |    T                 T              F\n(p|q)->r: true in 5 of 8 rows -> contingency\n((p->q)&(q->r))->(p->r): true in 8 of 8 rows -> tautology\np&~p: true in 0 of 8 rows -> contradiction",
