            "java": "p q | ~(p&q)  ~p|~q\nF F |    T      T\nF T |    T      T\nT F |    T      T\nT T |    F      F\n~(p&q)    vs ~p|~q       : equivalent (all 8 rows agree)\n~(p|q)    vs ~p&~q       : equivalent (all 8 rows agree)\np->q      vs ~p|q        : equivalent (all 8 rows agree)\np&(q|r)   vs (p&q)|(p&r) : equivalent (all 8 rows agree)\n~(p&q)    vs ~p&~q       : NOT equivalent: p=F q=T r=F gives T vs F\np->(q->r) vs (p->q)->r   : NOT equivalent: p=F q=F r=F gives T vs F"
