            "python": "2-permutations of ABCD: AB AC AD BA BC BD CA CB CD DA DB DC\nk=1: brute force 4, P(4,1) = 4!/3! = 4\nk=2: brute force 12, P(4,2) = 4!/2! = 12\nk=3: brute force 24, P(4,3) = 4!/1! = 24\nk=4: brute force 24, P(4,4) = 4!/0! = 24\n2-letter strings with repetition (AA allowed): 16 = 4^2",
            "javascript": "2-permutations of ABCD: AB AC AD BA BC BD CA CB CD DA DB DC\nk=1: brute force 4, P(4,1) = 4!/3! = 4\nk=2: brute force 12, P(4,2) = 4!/2! = 12\nk=3: brute force 24, P(4,3) = 4!/1! = 24\nk=4: brute force 24, P(4,4) = 4!/0! = 24\n2-letter strings with repetition (AA allowed): 16 = 4^2",
            "java": "2-permutations of ABCD: AB AC AD BA BC BD CA CB CD DA DB DC\nk=1: brute force 4, P(4,1) = 4!/3! = 4\nk=2: brute force 12, P(4,2) = 4!/2! = 12\nk=3: brute force 24, P(4,3) = 4!/1! = 24\nk=4: brute force 24, P(4,4) = 4!/0! = 24\n2-letter strings with repetition (AA allowed): 16 = 4^2"
