            "python": "2-combinations of ABCDE: AB AC AD AE BC BD BE CD CE DE\ncount = 10, C(5,2) = 5!/(2!*3!) = 10\neach has 2! orders, so 10 * 2 = 20 = P(5,2)\nk = 0..5 brute force: 1 5 10 10 5 1\nk = 0..5 C(5,k):      1 5 10 10 5 1\nsymmetry: C(5,2) = C(5,3) = 10 (choosing 2 to take = choosing 3 to leave)\ncommittees of 3 from 10 students: 120 = C(10,3) = 120",
            "java": "2-combinations of ABCDE: AB AC AD AE BC BD BE CD CE DE\ncount = 10, C(5,2) = 5!/(2!*3!) = 10\neach has 2! orders, so 10 * 2 = 20 = P(5,2)\nk = 0..5 brute force: 1 5 10 10 5 1\nk = 0..5 C(5,k):      1 5 10 10 5 1\nsymmetry: C(5,2) = C(5,3) = 10 (choosing 2 to take = choosing 3 to leave)\ncommittees of 3 from 10 students: 120 = C(10,3) = 120",
            "javascript": "2-combinations of ABCDE: AB AC AD AE BC BD BE CD CE DE\ncount = 10, C(5,2) = 5!/(2!*3!) = 10\neach has 2! orders, so 10 * 2 = 20 = P(5,2)\nk = 0..5 brute force: 1 5 10 10 5 1\nk = 0..5 C(5,k):      1 5 10 10 5 1\nsymmetry: C(5,2) = C(5,3) = 10 (choosing 2 to take = choosing 3 to leave)\ncommittees of 3 from 10 students: 120 = C(10,3) = 120"
