          "cpp": "Even squares: [4, 16, 36, 64, 100]\nAverage of values > 5: 8.00\nSum of odd numbers: 25\nGrouped by parity: {even=[2, 4, 6, 8, 10], odd=[1, 3, 5, 7, 9]}\nFirst three labels: <#1, #2, #3>\nFirst number whose square exceeds 40: 7",
          "java": "Even squares: [4, 16, 36, 64, 100]\nAverage of values > 5: 8.00\nSum of odd numbers: 25\nGrouped by parity: {even=[2, 4, 6, 8, 10], odd=[1, 3, 5, 7, 9]}\nFirst three labels: <#1, #2, #3>\nFirst number whose square exceeds 40: 7"
