          "java": "same Config instance: true (units=cm)\n[log] added circle 1.00 cm -> area 3.14\n[stats] shapes=1 total area=3.14\n[log] added square 2.00 cm -> area 4.00\n[stats] shapes=2 total area=7.14\n[log] added triangle 3.00 cm -> area 3.90\n[stats] shapes=3 total area=11.04\nerror: unknown shape 'hexagon'\nknown shapes: circle, hexagon, square, triangle\n[log] added hexagon 1.00 cm -> area 2.60\n[stats] shapes=4 total area=13.64\nsorted by area: hexagon 2.60, circle 3.14, triangle 3.90, square 4.00\nsorted by name: circle 3.14, hexagon 2.60, square 4.00, triangle 3.90",
