            "javascript": "> add Read chapter 5\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n    0 of 1 done\n> add Write lab report\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    0 of 2 done\n> done 1\n[x] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    1 of 2 done\n> done 7\nerror: no task number 7\n> add\nerror: title must not be empty\n> rename 2\nerror: unknown command 'rename'",
            "cpp": "> add Read chapter 5\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n    0 of 1 done\n> add Write lab report\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    0 of 2 done\n> done 1\n[x] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    1 of 2 done\n> done 7\nerror: no task number 7\n> add\nerror: title must not be empty\n> rename 2\nerror: unknown command 'rename'",
            "java": "> add Read chapter 5\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n    0 of 1 done\n> add Write lab report\n[ ] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    0 of 2 done\n> done 1\n[x] 1. Read chapter 5\n[ ] 2. Write lab report\n    1 of 2 done\n> done 7\nerror: no task number 7\n> add\nerror: title must not be empty\n> rename 2\nerror: unknown command 'rename'"
