            "java": "cycle 1: tests 2024 -> true, 2023 -> false\n  test first RED   v0 always false: failed [2024]\n  make pass  GREEN v1 divisible by 4: all 2 tests pass\ncycle 2: add test 1900 -> false\n  test first RED   v1 divisible by 4: failed [1900]\n  make pass  GREEN v2 by 4 but not by 100: all 3 tests pass\ncycle 3: add test 2000 -> true\n  test first RED   v2 by 4 but not by 100: failed [2000]\n  make pass  GREEN v3 if-chain with 400 rule: all 4 tests pass\nrefactor: same behavior, cleaner code, tests stay green\n  refactor   GREEN v4 one expression: all 4 tests pass"
