          "cpp": "Section: CS1-Java-A (2026)\nAlex scores=[88, 91, 84, 90], avg=88.25, letter=B\nStatus: PASS\nSam scores=[72, 67, 75, 70], avg=71.00, letter=C\nStatus: PASS\nKai scores=[55, 62, 70, 58], avg=61.25, letter=D\nStatus: REVIEW",
