            "javascript": "Square 2x2\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Square 4x4, area 16\nLabel \"Hello\"\n  not resizable\nPicture 4x3\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Picture 8x6, area 48",
            "cpp": "Square 2x2\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Square 4x4, area 16\nLabel \"Hello\"\n  not resizable\nPicture 4x3\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Picture 8x6, area 48",
            "java": "Square 2x2\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Square 4x4, area 16\nLabel \"Hello\"\n  not resizable\nPicture 4x3\n  resizable: scaled x2 -> Picture 8x6, area 48"
