            "cpp": "same runtime class: true\nafter raw add, size = 2\ncontents: [hello, 42]\nget(0) as String -> hello\nget(1) as String -> cast failed: element is not a String",
            "java": "same runtime class: true\nafter raw add, size = 2\ncontents: [hello, 42]\nget(0) as String -> hello\nget(1) as String -> cast failed: element is not a String"
