            "javascript": "block 1: normal exit\n  create log (constructor ran)\n  create db (constructor ran)\n  use log\n  use db\n  close db\n  close log\nblock 2: exception inside the block\n  create file (constructor ran)\n  use file\n  close file\n  caught after close: file failed\ndb is still reachable through kept, state = closed\nkept = null -> db unreachable; the GC may reclaim it at any later time",
            "cpp": "block 1: normal exit\n  create log (constructor ran)\n  create db (constructor ran)\n  use log\n  use db\n  close db\n  close log\nblock 2: exception inside the block\n  create file (constructor ran)\n  use file\n  close file\n  caught after close: file failed\ndb is still reachable through kept, state = closed\nkept = null -> db unreachable; the GC may reclaim it at any later time",
            "java": "block 1: normal exit\n  create log (constructor ran)\n  create db (constructor ran)\n  use log\n  use db\n  close db\n  close log\nblock 2: exception inside the block\n  create file (constructor ran)\n  use file\n  close file\n  caught after close: file failed\ndb is still reachable through kept, state = closed\nkept = null -> db unreachable; the GC may reclaim it at any later time"
