            "java": "before any GC:       strong->report soft->thumbnail weak->session weak->config strong->config\nGC, memory is fine:  strong->report soft->thumbnail weak->null weak->config strong->config\nGC, memory is low:   strong->report soft->null weak->null weak->config strong->config\nreal weak reference while strongly held -> same object: true",
