            "cpp": "open: autoCommit = true, isClosed = false\nauto-commit deposit of 10 into A -> committed A=110 B=50\ntx 1: moved 30 A->B, not committed yet -> committed A=110 B=50\ntx 1: commit() -> committed A=80 B=80\ntx 2: credit B 500 ok, debit A 500 -> SQLException: CHECK constraint failed: balance >= 0\ntx 2: rollback() -> committed A=80 B=80 (the credit to B was undone)\nafter try-with-resources: isClosed = true\ncreateStatement() after close -> SQLException: Connection is closed",
