            "java": "getString(1) before next() -> SQLException: Before start of result set\nrow 1: id=1 name=Ana gpa=3.80 (wasNull=false)\nrow 2: id=2 name=Luis gpa=0.00 (wasNull=true)\nrow 3: id=3 name=Marta gpa=3.25 (wasNull=false)\nnext() returned false: the cursor is after the last row\nmapped: Student(1, Ana, 3.80)\nmapped: Student(2, Luis, null)\nmapped: Student(3, Marta, 3.25)"
