            "java": "Simple paths from A to F: 2\n  A -> B -> D -> E -> F  (length 4)\n  A -> C -> D -> E -> F  (length 4)\nShortest: A -> B -> D -> E -> F with 4 edges\nCycle found: C -> D -> B -> A -> C (length 4)\nA walk may repeat vertices: A -> B -> A -> C is a walk, not a path",
