            "python": "level      size                 time   if a register read took 1 second\nregister   a few bytes         0.3 ns   1 s\nL1 cache   64 KB                 1 ns   3 s\nL3 cache   32 MB                10 ns   33 s\nRAM        16 GB               100 ns   6 min\nSSD        1 TB            100,000 ns   4 days\nhard disk  4 TB         10,000,000 ns   386 days\n\nread 100: miss  cache = [100]\nread 104: miss  cache = [100, 104]\nread 108: miss  cache = [100, 104, 108]\nread 100: hit   cache = [104, 108, 100]\nread 104: hit   cache = [108, 100, 104]\nread 108: hit   cache = [100, 104, 108]\nread 200: miss  cache = [100, 104, 108, 200]\nread 100: hit   cache = [104, 108, 200, 100]\n4 hits, 4 misses"
