            "python": "search 23:\n  range [0, 9] mid=4 a[mid]=16\n  range [5, 9] mid=7 a[mid]=56\n  range [5, 6] mid=5 a[mid]=23\n  -> index 5\nsearch 40:\n  range [0, 9] mid=4 a[mid]=16\n  range [5, 9] mid=7 a[mid]=56\n  range [5, 6] mid=5 a[mid]=23\n  range [6, 6] mid=6 a[mid]=38\n  -> index -1\nplain search for 30 lands on index 3\nfirst 30 at 2, last 30 at 5, count 4\ninsertion point for 35: 6"
