            "python": "frequencies: { =1, a=9, b=2, c=1, d=1, k=1, l=1, m=1, r=2, z=1}\n  merge ' '=1 + 'c'=1 -> 2\n  merge 'd'=1 + 'k'=1 -> 2\n  merge 'l'=1 + 'm'=1 -> 2\n  merge 'z'=1 + 'b'=2 -> 3\n  merge 'r'=2 + (2)=2 -> 4\n  merge (2)=2 + (2)=2 -> 4\n  merge (3)=3 + (4)=4 -> 7\n  merge (4)=4 + (7)=7 -> 11\n  merge 'a'=9 + (11)=11 -> 20\n  ' ' x1 -> 11110\n  'a' x9 -> 0\n  'b' x2 -> 1101\n  'c' x1 -> 11111\n  'd' x1 -> 1000\n  'k' x1 -> 1001\n  'l' x1 -> 1010\n  'm' x1 -> 1011\n  'r' x2 -> 1110\n  'z' x1 -> 1100\nHuffman: 55 bits; fixed 4-bit code: 80 bits; 8-bit ASCII: 160 bits"
