            "python": "weights [1, 8, 5, 2, 9, 6, 3, 10, 7, 4, 1, 8, 5, 2, 9, 6, 3, 10, 7, 4]\nvalues  [10, 23, 36, 12, 25, 38, 14, 27, 40, 16, 29, 42, 18, 31, 44, 20, 33, 46, 22, 35]\nbest value 354 (naive) = 354 (memoized)\nnaive calls: 951524, memoized calls: 1391, states solved: 725 of 1020"
