            "python": "values [7, 4, 6, 8, 5, 3, 9, 2], overall min 2\nset position 5 to 1, path from leaf to root:\n    [5,5] min = 1\n    [4,5] min = 1\n    [4,7] min = 1\n    [0,7] min = 1\nset position 2 to 9, path from leaf to root:\n    [2,2] min = 9\n    [2,3] min = 8\n    [0,3] min = 4\n    [0,7] min = 1\nmin of [1, 6] = 1 (tree read 11 nodes; a scan reads 6 elements and gets 1)"
